              "widgets_values": [
                "Monumental contemporary abstract surrealist cinema, photoreal sculptural installation, brutalist concrete, obsidian reflecting water, one continuous deep-crimson silk ribbon as the sole protagonist, no human figures, no faces, no birds, no lettering. Restrained charcoal grey, crimson and pale gold palette. Extreme architectural scale, immaculate composition, dramatic volumetric side light, atmospheric depth, tactile silk with natural folds, subtle fine film grain. Landscape 16:9 film still, full bleed, no border, no captions, no watermark. One clear focal subject. The ribbon gently descends and touches the plinth once; warm light slowly spreads along existing floor seams. No destruction, no new architecture. Use the supplied first and last frame as the exact visual anchors. One continuous shot. No speech, no captions.",
                704,
                384,
